## Why This Is Asked
Tests DP over fixed-count intervals with a mandatory gap, plus reconstruction to output exact blocks. This combines segment sums with a combinatorial constraint, a common interview pattern.

## Key Concepts
- DP over prefixes with a fixed number of blocks
- Gap handling via s-2 predecessor index
- Prefix sums for O(1) interval sums
- Path reconstruction via backpointers

## Code Example
